<title>USA: Zero Corp to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Zero Corp to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zero Corp said it will repurchase up to 400,000 shares of its common stock in open market transactions.</p>
<p>It said the shares will be repurchased from time to time as market conditions warrant. The shares will be used to satisfy requirements of the company's stock option plan and for other corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
